main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ friend default arg names member's own parameter: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
N5008 [class.friend]/1 + [temp.local]/1 + [namespace.memdef]/3: the
friend's name is a namespace member, but its declaration is looked up in
the class -- here the enclosing member class template's own parameter
(as a default template argument) and the class's member alias.
